        }
      ],
      "followupQuery": "",
      "requirementId": "attribute_4",
      "requiredPoints": [
        "First check whether the two labels describe different objects or dimensions (application lifecycle status versus workflow node/taskStatus versus payment status) rather than the same measure.",
        "Confirm both observations refer to the same application, same source page and same query time before treating them as a contradiction.",
        "If the scopes, versions or times differ, keep both observations visible and reconcile them rather than picking one arbitrarily.",
        "Verification is read-only; no data is changed."
